  "description": "Chinese calendar engine layer: four pillars (四柱) with 立春/節 boundaries, 建除 duty, lunar labels, and hour slots — a typed interface with a tyme4ts-backed engine, returning @soul-atelier/core GanZhi values.",
  "keywords": [
    "chinese-calendar",
    "four-pillars",
    "ganzhi",
    "lunar",
    "solar-terms",
